1
00:00:00,810 --> 00:00:07,190
This short video shows doctors how to review and approve their requests, and follow their patients' lab work.

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:12,060
Open the system link, write your name and password, and tap Sign in.

3
00:00:13,309 --> 00:00:18,021
Your page opens on Reviews. The cards at the top count your requests:

4
00:00:18,021 --> 00:00:21,709
waiting for your review, approved, sent, and received.

5
00:00:22,159 --> 00:00:27,559
Tap a request to open it. You see each item and the quantity the nurse asked for.

6
00:00:28,009 --> 00:00:34,179
If a quantity is too much or too little, change it. You can also write a note on any item.

7
00:00:34,630 --> 00:00:38,880
Then tap Approve. The request goes to procurement right away.

8
00:00:39,331 --> 00:00:45,311
If something is wrong, write the reason and tap Reject. The request goes back to the nurse.

9
00:00:49,597 --> 00:00:55,477
On the Lab page, follow your patients' lab work: where each case is now, and when it is due.

10
00:00:56,123 --> 00:01:02,413
That's it. Please review your requests quickly, so your clinic gets its supplies on time. Thank you!
